(7352149, 1150281, 114285, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2015-05-21 11:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352220, 1150298, 96915, '<td valign="top">Although simple, this is very pleasing to look at.  One of my favorites out of the blurred green shots.</td>', 'Although simple, this is very pleasing to look at.  One of my favorites out of the blurred green shots.', '2015-05-21 17:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352221, 1150047, 96915, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites out of all the green blurred shots.  The trees give it depth.  Bumping up.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites out of all the green blurred shots.  The trees give it depth.  Bumping up.', '2015-05-21 17:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352225, 1150062, 177322, '<td valign="top">There is a ghostly sense to this but a good ghostly, feminine - like a Wizard of Oz emerald sylph.  I like the fact that one gets an almost-in-focus peep of the trees - a check back to reality.  Lovely.</td>', 'There is a ghostly sense to this but a good ghostly, feminine - like a Wizard of Oz emerald sylph.  I like the fact that one gets an almost-in-focus peep of the trees - a check back to reality.  Lovely.', '2015-05-21 17:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352230, 1149987, 177322, '<td valign="top">For me, this has a blue ribbon already pinned to it.  Despite the screaming green it is calming in its undulations with the cream colored edges of the leaves(?) running diagonally through it. The darker upper left adds a bit of mystery and the hard vertical line on the right has that halo of yellow  suggesting a ray of sunshine.  Simply beautiful.  Best of luck!</td>', 'For me, this has a blue ribbon already pinned to it.  Despite the screaming green it is calming in its undulations with the cream colored edges of the leaves(?) running diagonally through it. The darker upper left adds a bit of mystery and the hard vertical line on the right has that halo of yellow  suggesting a ray of sunshine.  Simply beautiful.  Best of luck!', '2015-05-21 17:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352257, 1149839, 177322, '<td valign="top">Well, this is certainly different. While I like the varying depths (foreground to background) of the tubular forms, the highly chaotic angles don''t resonate, for me.  The erratic angles don''t guide my eye through the image or to a particular place in it.  The color is fabulous, though.</td>', 'Well, this is certainly different. While I like the varying depths (foreground to background) of the tubular forms, the highly chaotic angles don''t resonate, for me.  The erratic angles don''t guide my eye through the image or to a particular place in it.  The color is fabulous, though.', '2015-05-21 19:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352262, 1150304, 177322, '<td valign="top">Sorry, that title seems like a label for the latest flu strain.  <br/> <br/>The image, however, is quite captivating with the in-and-out-of-focus interwoven threads.  There is a sense of force with the in-focus diagonal that is really the brawn of the impression.  Yet, the upper left and lower right, with the varying light and darkness, invite the viewer to peek - to explore what possibilities, more delicate, frolic in the corners.  Very creative.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Sorry, that title seems like a label for the latest flu strain.   The image, however, is quite captivating with the in-and-out-of-focus interwoven threads.  There is a sense of force with the in-focus diagonal that is really the brawn of the impression.  Yet, the upper left and lower right, with the varying light and darkness, invite the viewer to peek - to explore what possibilities, more delicate, frolic in the corners.  Very creative. Good luck.', '2015-05-21 19:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352506, 1150260, 177322, '<td valign="top">The blue and brown diagonals across the bottom provide a lovely foundation for the more vertical striations of the green.  With the green functioning as the main movement in the image, a nice basic form has been crafted.  The undulations of varying color within the green, brown and blue gently guide the eye through this dreamy creation. A most arresting visual sensation. Best of luck.</td>', 'The blue and brown diagonals across the bottom provide a lovely foundation for the more vertical striations of the green.  With the green functioning as the main movement in the image, a nice basic form has been crafted.  The undulations of varying color within the green, brown and blue gently guide the eye through this dreamy creation. A most arresting visual sensation. Best of luck.', '2015-05-22 14:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352508, 1150155, 177322, '<td valign="top">This is so incredibly delicate and soothing. The soft breeziness is very lulling - like lying in a hammock and letting the palms rustle above.  The title defines the sensation of this wispy creation most effectively - chiffon.  Wishing you the best in earning a place in the front page line up.</td>', 'This is so incredibly delicate and soothing. The soft breeziness is very lulling - like lying in a hammock and letting the palms rustle above.  The title defines the sensation of this wispy creation most effectively - chiffon.  Wishing you the best in earning a place in the front page line up.', '2015-05-22 14:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352516, 1149853, 177322, '<td valign="top">The diagonal slashes of vivid green and black convey strength, for me.  While it is a very powerful, masculine image the nuanced color variations in the green suggests a touch of the feminine.  I could see this as a picture hung over the fireplace in some bachelor''s pad. Nice work.</td>', 'The diagonal slashes of vivid green and black convey strength, for me.  While it is a very powerful, masculine image the nuanced color variations in the green suggests a touch of the feminine.  I could see this as a picture hung over the fireplace in some bachelor''s pad. Nice work.', '2015-05-22 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352537, 1150190, 177322, '<td valign="top">Scintillating and starry!  Really fun!  Astonishing macro as much as an abstract.</td>', 'Scintillating and starry!  Really fun!  Astonishing macro as much as an abstract.', '2015-05-22 15:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352553, 1150327, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the by removing the sky, this would become much more abstract. Lovely shot!</td>', 'I think the by removing the sky, this would become much more abstract. Lovely shot!', '2015-05-22 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352554, 1150243, 10785, '<td valign="top">I had many abstract thoughts while viewing this! Well done!</td>', 'I had many abstract thoughts while viewing this! Well done!', '2015-05-22 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352635, 1150282, 177322, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too helter-skelter for my personal taste, nonetheless, a very clever interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too helter-skelter for my personal taste, nonetheless, a very clever interpretation of the challenge.', '2015-05-23 01:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352636, 1150274, 177322, '<td valign="top">Brings back childhood memories of watching the ants suck the honeydew at the ends of the peony buds.</td>', 'Brings back childhood memories of watching the ants suck the honeydew at the ends of the peony buds.', '2015-05-23 01:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352639, 1150327, 177322, '<td valign="top">What sensuous undulations of grass!  The light was perfect for capturing the shadows thus the different shades of green. Very lovely.  Is this somewhere in the Flint Hills?</td>', 'What sensuous undulations of grass!  The light was perfect for capturing the shadows thus the different shades of green. Very lovely.  Is this somewhere in the Flint Hills?', '2015-05-23 01:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352640, 1150289, 177322, '<td valign="top">Captivating array of greens - from white asparagus to black avocado, so the title is perfect! The brightness of the kite shape is a pleasant contrast to the soft folds of the more linear form on the right. Its ephemeral quality and seductive flow should earn this a spot on the front page. Best of luck.</td>', 'Captivating array of greens - from white asparagus to black avocado, so the title is perfect! The brightness of the kite shape is a pleasant contrast to the soft folds of the more linear form on the right. Its ephemeral quality and seductive flow should earn this a spot on the front page. Best of luck.', '2015-05-23 01:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352693, 1150306, 114225, '<td valign="top">I find myself drawn to this.</td>', 'I find myself drawn to this.', '2015-05-24 00:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352694, 1149929, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Find it hard to call this an abstract.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Find it hard to call this an abstract.', '2015-05-24 00:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352695, 1150062, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. Detail in blur is hard, but when it works, it really works.</td>', 'I like this. Detail in blur is hard, but when it works, it really works.', '2015-05-24 00:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352696, 1150198, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oh, a soda bottle. Nice.</td>', 'Oh, a soda bottle. Nice.', '2015-05-24 00:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352697, 1149909, 114225, '<td valign="top">Electric.</td>', 'Electric.', '2015-05-24 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352698, 1150243, 114225, '<td valign="top">Failing to see any green here.</td>', 'Failing to see any green here.', '2015-05-24 00:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352699, 1149922, 114225, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this.</td>', 'I enjoy this.', '2015-05-24 00:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352700, 1149981, 114225, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, but I''m having a hard time classifying it as abstract.</td>', 'A very nice photo, but I''m having a hard time classifying it as abstract.', '2015-05-24 00:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352701, 1149839, 114225, '<td valign="top">There is something magic about this.</td>', 'There is something magic about this.', '2015-05-24 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352702, 1150327, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great landscape, doesn''t feel abstract to me.</td>', 'Great landscape, doesn''t feel abstract to me.', '2015-05-24 00:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352752, 1150295, 177322, '<td valign="top">The pronounced vertical movement imparts an uplifting mood; <i>ergo</i>, it is a rather cheery piece with bits of interest added by the blue-gray water patches and the heftiness of white and black of the tree trunks(?).  Good luck.</td>', 'The pronounced vertical movement imparts an uplifting mood; ergo, it is a rather cheery piece with bits of interest added by the blue-gray water patches and the heftiness of white and black of the tree trunks(?).  Good luck.', '2015-05-24 12:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352753, 1150292, 177322, '<td valign="top">That flourish of gay pink really does make this feel like a spring fling.  I like the way all the points come together at the top left.</td>', 'That flourish of gay pink really does make this feel like a spring fling.  I like the way all the points come together at the top left.', '2015-05-24 12:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352772, 1150325, 177322, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing vortex.  This is so well crafted, that the viewer''s translation could be that is either an ascension or a decent - or an energy that is dynamic in both directions. Then... there is that suggestion of a tunnel coming/leaving from the upper left corner.  Quite a complex creation, well crafted.  The more I study it, the more I find to study.  Hope this ribbons for you.</td>', 'Mesmerizing vortex.  This is so well crafted, that the viewer''s translation could be that is either an ascension or a decent - or an energy that is dynamic in both directions. Then... there is that suggestion of a tunnel coming/leaving from the upper left corner.  Quite a complex creation, well crafted.  The more I study it, the more I find to study.  Hope this ribbons for you.', '2015-05-24 13:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352795, 1150325, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the movement...</td>', 'I like the movement...', '2015-05-24 20:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352796, 1150188, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice short little strokes of light. It keeps a somewhat recognizable scene to allow the viewer to enter in.</td>', 'Nice short little strokes of light. It keeps a somewhat recognizable scene to allow the viewer to enter in.', '2015-05-24 20:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352797, 1150273, 10785, '<td valign="top">Super interesting subject. Yet the lack of detail from shooting through the glass takes away.</td>', 'Super interesting subject. Yet the lack of detail from shooting through the glass takes away.', '2015-05-24 20:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352798, 1150266, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes. I feel the highlights and shadows need a little work due to over-exposure in camera.</td>', 'Nice shapes. I feel the highlights and shadows need a little work due to over-exposure in camera.', '2015-05-24 20:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352799, 1149919, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the slice of red on the bottom. It seems to anchor this.</td>', 'I like the slice of red on the bottom. It seems to anchor this.', '2015-05-24 20:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352844, 1150287, 33068, '<td valign="top">Good eye. In my top 3.</td>', 'Good eye. In my top 3.', '2015-05-24 23:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352846, 1150047, 33068, '<td valign="top">Oh this is one my favorite techniques to practice in the mountains.  This turned out excellent.  8</td>', 'Oh this is one my favorite techniques to practice in the mountains.  This turned out excellent.  8', '2015-05-24 23:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352848, 1150008, 33068, '<td valign="top">I love the blur and different shades of green.  I keep coming back to this image so I''m bumping it up.</td>', 'I love the blur and different shades of green.  I keep coming back to this image so I''m bumping it up.', '2015-05-24 23:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352867, 1150069, 177322, '<td valign="top">Good concept nicely presented with well executed composition. This appears as though it may have been buzzed or simplified, processes which I greatly enjoy - normally.  The degree to which this as been simplified leaves the image, for me, feeling pixelated.  And, I think, it is due to the inherent  coarseness of the ribbon''s threads.  I wonder if MORE simplification would smooth out those hard squares and lend to a more flowing impression?  Nonetheless, the form and lines are topnotch, it is the "texture" that just didn''t work for me.  <br/> <br/>Please do not be offended by reaction; remember, abstract photography is an art form, subject to the viewer''s emotions. Regardless of my experience with the overall texture, I think your eye is very good for this type of work.  So, quite sincerely, I wish you good luck with the image.</td>', 'Good concept nicely presented with well executed composition. This appears as though it may have been buzzed or simplified, processes which I greatly enjoy - normally.  The degree to which this as been simplified leaves the image, for me, feeling pixelated.  And, I think, it is due to the inherent  coarseness of the ribbon''s threads.  I wonder if MORE simplification would smooth out those hard squares and lend to a more flowing impression?  Nonetheless, the form and lines are topnotch, it is the "texture" that just didn''t work for me.   Please do not be offended by reaction; remember, abstract photography is an art form, subject to the viewer''s emotions. Regardless of my experience with the overall texture, I think your eye is very good for this type of work.  So, quite sincerely, I wish you good luck with the image.', '2015-05-25 00:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353195, 1149909, 177322, '<td valign="top">The sense of a burrow is quite pronounced and the journey via those well defined lines decorated with tendrils is pleasing, but, for me, the center vaporizes the odyssey.  For me, it is too large, too OOF, and contains nothing nearly as interesting as the excellent lines directing the eye to the center of the image.  I think the balance of your abstract composition is very effective; I just wish it gave me a reward once I got to the center.  Valiant effort; it just doesn''t work for me personally.<br/> <br/>Please know, I am NOT voting in this challenge; only commenting.<br/> <br/>Is this a yucca?</td>', 'The sense of a burrow is quite pronounced and the journey via those well defined lines decorated with tendrils is pleasing, but, for me, the center vaporizes the odyssey.  For me, it is too large, too OOF, and contains nothing nearly as interesting as the excellent lines directing the eye to the center of the image.  I think the balance of your abstract composition is very effective; I just wish it gave me a reward once I got to the center.  Valiant effort; it just doesn''t work for me personally. Please know, I am NOT voting in this challenge; only commenting. Is this a yucca?', '2015-05-25 15:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353196, 1150287, 177322, '<td valign="top">In a challenge filled with plants (my own included), this abstract using metal and shadow is quite refreshing.  Good luck.</td>', 'In a challenge filled with plants (my own included), this abstract using metal and shadow is quite refreshing.  Good luck.', '2015-05-25 15:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353197, 1150221, 177322, '<td valign="top">The fan of green is very eye-catching. The black areas, in my opinion, overpower the effect of the "fan."  Their form is not complimentary to the lovely arches in the "fan" area.  The little Tinker Bell of green in the lower left is discordant with both the "fan" as well as the black forms.  I think your eye is very good to identify the "fan," and, personally, would have enjoyed a more isolated exploration of that form and line.<br/> <br/>This is such a exotic shape, I do hope you share with us what it is.</td>', 'The fan of green is very eye-catching. The black areas, in my opinion, overpower the effect of the "fan."  Their form is not complimentary to the lovely arches in the "fan" area.  The little Tinker Bell of green in the lower left is discordant with both the "fan" as well as the black forms.  I think your eye is very good to identify the "fan," and, personally, would have enjoyed a more isolated exploration of that form and line. This is such a exotic shape, I do hope you share with us what it is.', '2015-05-25 15:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353253, 1149983, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not entirely abstract but also not without merit.<br/> <br/>Initially I looked for the "shiny perfectness" usually associated with such photos, but when I didn''t see it I stopped and looked a little longer.<br/> <br/>There''s some interesting detail, particularly around the speckling in the leaf. Don''t care too much for the water drops, but I can''t say for sure if it would be any better or worse without them.</td>', 'Not entirely abstract but also not without merit. Initially I looked for the "shiny perfectness" usually associated with such photos, but when I didn''t see it I stopped and looked a little longer. There''s some interesting detail, particularly around the speckling in the leaf. Don''t care too much for the water drops, but I can''t say for sure if it would be any better or worse without them.', '2015-05-25 18:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353255, 1150062, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is peaceful, makes me think of a happy journey on a train. <br/> <br/>I would expect to see something like this hanging in the foyer of a large corporate building.</td>', 'This is peaceful, makes me think of a happy journey on a train.  I would expect to see something like this hanging in the foyer of a large corporate building.', '2015-05-25 18:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353257, 1150121, 101117, '<td valign="top">I find if I look at this for long enough I start to see recognisable shapes in the forms. However, the slightly putrid colours put me off looking at it for too long.</td>', 'I find if I look at this for long enough I start to see recognisable shapes in the forms. However, the slightly putrid colours put me off looking at it for too long.', '2015-05-25 18:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353259, 1149909, 101117, '<td valign="top">Certainly one of the more abstract I''ve seen in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Remember when WinAmp was the big thing for playing MP3s and it had that visualisation plugin thing, this reminds me a lot of that!</td>', 'Certainly one of the more abstract I''ve seen in the challenge. Remember when WinAmp was the big thing for playing MP3s and it had that visualisation plugin thing, this reminds me a lot of that!', '2015-05-25 18:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353260, 1150256, 101117, '<td valign="top">Don''t think the lighting flatters this particularly. It also sits in that middle ground where it''s not close enough to be abstract but not far enough to be complete so it lacks any real viewing interest for me.</td>', 'Don''t think the lighting flatters this particularly. It also sits in that middle ground where it''s not close enough to be abstract but not far enough to be complete so it lacks any real viewing interest for me.', '2015-05-25 18:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353262, 1150047, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen lots of photos of this style and I do quite like them. This particular one for some reason has a very odd effect in that I feel like I''m actually looking at a curved image, my brain is struggling slightly to process it!<br/> <br/>Not sure if that was your intention (if it was then it''s remarkably well done). I think if this was big enough it might actually play with my sense of level!</td>', 'I''ve seen lots of photos of this style and I do quite like them. This particular one for some reason has a very odd effect in that I feel like I''m actually looking at a curved image, my brain is struggling slightly to process it! Not sure if that was your intention (if it was then it''s remarkably well done). I think if this was big enough it might actually play with my sense of level!', '2015-05-25 18:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353263, 1150226, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is well framed, well lit and generally well presented, but it doesn''t hold a great deal of interest for me as a photo. <br/> <br/>I can''t say for sure what it is, I''m guessing a furniture piece but at the same time I don''t find myself with a great desire to know so it doesn''t really hold my attention.</td>', 'This is well framed, well lit and generally well presented, but it doesn''t hold a great deal of interest for me as a photo.  I can''t say for sure what it is, I''m guessing a furniture piece but at the same time I don''t find myself with a great desire to know so it doesn''t really hold my attention.', '2015-05-25 18:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353264, 1149919, 101117, '<td valign="top">This could actually be a landscape photo albeit of a very weird landscape but at first and even second glance it''s very hard to get a sense of scale here!<br/> <br/>Interesting as I scrolled down to comment my screen cut off about the top third of the photo and for some reason it holds a lot more interest for me like that.</td>', 'This could actually be a landscape photo albeit of a very weird landscape but at first and even second glance it''s very hard to get a sense of scale here! Interesting as I scrolled down to comment my screen cut off about the top third of the photo and for some reason it holds a lot more interest for me like that.', '2015-05-25 18:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
