(7354156, 1150217, 27158, '<td valign="top">I am a big fan of this type photography. Love the motion, color and emotion that is brought out by introducing a dimension of time.<br/> <br/>However, I am bothered (distracted) by the two areas of desaturated color. They seem out of place and artificial, esp in contrast with the similar areas that were highly saturated and contrasty. Even so, I would have place you much higher.</td>', 'I am a big fan of this type photography. Love the motion, color and emotion that is brought out by introducing a dimension of time. However, I am bothered (distracted) by the two areas of desaturated color. They seem out of place and artificial, esp in contrast with the similar areas that were highly saturated and contrasty. Even so, I would have place you much higher.', '2015-05-27 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7354161, 1150217, 50641, '<td valign="top">really beautiful!!  fwiw my eyeballs keep wanting to crop off the top 1/4 but my brain isn''t sure why.</td>', 'really beautiful!!  fwiw my eyeballs keep wanting to crop off the top 1/4 but my brain isn''t sure why.', '2015-05-27 15:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7354190, 1150304, 30861, '<td valign="top">Awesome :-)</td>', 'Awesome :-)', '2015-05-27 16:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7354209, 1150217, 150277, '<td valign="top">I suppose I''m not a huge fan of motion blur since my brain really likes order, and I struggled with the mix of heavy versus light lines and the opposition of blurred and nearly in focus.  The main part of this image that really didn''t connect with me was the blur of the whites of the shirts, it was just too big a white blur and then at the next second below were bike tires almost in focus.  Was just a bit to uneven for me I think.</td>', 'I suppose I''m not a huge fan of motion blur since my brain really likes order, and I struggled with the mix of heavy versus light lines and the opposition of blurred and nearly in focus.  The main part of this image that really didn''t connect with me was the blur of the whites of the shirts, it was just too big a white blur and then at the next second below were bike tires almost in focus.  Was just a bit to uneven for me I think.', '2015-05-27 16:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7354211, 1150328, 20799, '<td valign="top">Love the sky.</td>', 'Love the sky.', '2015-05-27 16:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7354212, 1150309, 150277, '<td valign="top">I never would have guessed these were trees.  There is a beautiful painting like quality to this image, but the bottoms of the white lines - there was something about them I just didn''t love.  (Some of the really thin lines just felt a bit harsh I guess might be the best word to explain what I''m feeling, just not as smooth as the rest of the image - and my brain really struggles with uneveness.)  But pretty image overall to me.</td>', 'I never would have guessed these were trees.  There is a beautiful painting like quality to this image, but the bottoms of the white lines - there was something about them I just didn''t love.  (Some of the really thin lines just felt a bit harsh I guess might be the best word to explain what I''m feeling, just not as smooth as the rest of the image - and my brain really struggles with uneveness.)  But pretty image overall to me.', '2015-05-27 16:43:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7354220, 1149987, 96664, '<td valign="top">Reminds me a little bit of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=48228" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sherpet</a>''s work.</td>', 'Reminds me a little bit of  sherpet''s work.', '2015-05-27 17:09:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7354224, 1150217, 16106, '<td valign="top">This is a shot that rewards slow inspection. I love the little holes of focus and the oblongs of blur. I agree with skewsme about the top distracting from the action even it if provides much needed green for the challenge, it steals power. If you view a shot for 3 seconds in scoring, this level of complexity is tough to enjoy, and on that level it is a "meh" shot, not super green, not at all simple. The correlation between a great photograph and great entry in a challenge is not robust.</td>', 'This is a shot that rewards slow inspection. I love the little holes of focus and the oblongs of blur. I agree with skewsme about the top distracting from the action even it if provides much needed green for the challenge, it steals power. If you view a shot for 3 seconds in scoring, this level of complexity is tough to enjoy, and on that level it is a "meh" shot, not super green, not at all simple. The correlation between a great photograph and great entry in a challenge is not robust.', '2015-05-27 17:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7354313, 1150309, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m very surprised at the score, too.  Reminds me of the dripping data in some movie (the Matrix, maybe?). Definitely green, definitely abstract, and formed a coherent whole - to me, anyway.</td>', 'I''m very surprised at the score, too.  Reminds me of the dripping data in some movie (the Matrix, maybe?). Definitely green, definitely abstract, and formed a coherent whole - to me, anyway.', '2015-05-27 20:07:10.000000', NULL, 0),
